OL,3,GNEWSAWoman's rape lies sentence 'unduly
OL,4,Alenient'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who falsely accused 10 men of
OL,7,Fraping her has had her prison sentence
OL,8,Fincreased by two-and-a-half years after
OL,9,Fthe Court of Appeal ruled her original
OL,10,Fterm was "unduly lenient".
OL,12,FStacey Sharples, 31, made false reports
OL,13,Fcausing men to be held in custody at
OL,14,Fpolice stations, lose jobs and
OL,15,Frelationships, and be separated from
OL,16,Ftheir children.
OL,18,FShe met the men from Greater Manchester
OL,19,Fon Facebook and dating apps Plenty of
OL,20,FFish and Badoo between 2013 and 2019,
OL,21,Fwhen she was aged between 18 and 24.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
